	<section_number>3.2-6005</section_number>
	<catch_line>Notice of quarantine</catch_line>
	<text>
		The State Veterinarian, or his representative, may give such notice as may be necessary to make a quarantine effective.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 3-574; 1966, c. 702, § 3.1-732; 2008, c. 860.</history>
